1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--video-creation","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/video-creation","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/video-creation","sourceHash":"be7c6e0d961e93caceff1e834a1cf457b6fafc770e8b3b01a4dbb53b53714b66","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:11:23.430Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Video Creation","zh":"视频创作"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Creating video content in the target language — essays, presentations, tutorials — is a powerful way to practice multiple skills in a single activity. Not just hitting record and talking for 10 minutes (although that can be useful too), but actually planning and creating a video.","zh":"用目标语言创作视频内容——文章、演讲、教程——是一次练习多项技能的高效方式。不是简单地按下录制键说上10分钟（虽然这也很有用），而是真正去规划并制作一段视频。"}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You don't need to actually publish your video for it to be excellent practice!","zh":"即使不实际发布视频，它仍然会是非常棒的练习！"}},{"id":"why-its-effective","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Why It's Effective","zh":"为什么有效"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Video creation exercises nearly every language skill simultaneously:","zh":"视频创作几乎能同时练习每一项语言技能："}},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"<strong>Writing:</strong> You draft a script or outline","zh":"<strong>写作：</strong>你要起草脚本或提纲"},{"en":"<strong>Analysis:</strong> You review the script/recordings alone and/or with a tutor","zh":"<strong>分析：</strong>你要独自和/或与导师一起检查脚本或录音"},{"en":"<strong>Reading:</strong> You research and read source material","zh":"<strong>阅读：</strong>你要查找并阅读资料"},{"en":"<strong>Speaking:</strong> You record yourself talking","zh":"<strong>口语：</strong>你要录下自己说话的内容"},{"en":"<strong>Listening:</strong> You review your own recordings while editing","zh":"<strong>听力：</strong>剪辑时要回听自己的录音"},{"en":"<strong>Expression:</strong> You have the specific goal of clearly presenting ideas, which is often missing from other output activities","zh":"<strong>表达：</strong>你有明确的目标：清晰地呈现观点，而这往往是其他输出活动所缺少的"}]},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"It also forces sustained output. A 10-minute video requires WAY more than 10 minutes of recording (usually a few hours), which builds stamina and automaticity in a way that short conversational exchanges don't.","zh":"它还会迫使你进行持续输出。一段10分钟的视频需要的时间远远超过10分钟的录制时间（通常要花几小时），能以短暂对话交流无法做到的方式培养耐力和自动化程度。"}},{"id":"how-to-get-started","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"How to Get Started","zh":"如何开始"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The first place to start is with monologuing and writing, if you haven't done much of that before. As you get more comfortable, you can start to write longer texts, more in the style of an article.","zh":"如果你以前没有进行过太多这类练习，最开始可以先练习独白和写作。逐渐熟悉之后，你可以开始写更长的文本，风格也可以更接近文章。"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Then, you can tweak it to be more like a video or start a new topic. You should also schedule tutoring sessions and review your text with a native to make sure you're getting your ideas across the way you want.","zh":"接着，你可以把它调整得更像视频脚本，或者开始一个新主题。你还应该安排辅导课，请母语者帮你检查文本，确保你表达出了自己想要传达的意思。"}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"That's a lot of work! But incredibly powerful. Once you have a script to the point where you're more or less happy with it, you should start to read it aloud (many times) and work on the delivery before setting up your phone (or camera) to record.","zh":"这需要做很多工作！但效果非常强大。脚本完成到让你基本满意的程度后，你应该先大声朗读（很多遍），练习表达方式，然后再架好手机（或相机）进行录制。"}},{"id":"segment-0011","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Editing can be done with an app like CapCut, iMovie, DaVinci Resolve or KdenLive. It does NOT need to be pretty! You can add as much or as little.","zh":"你可以使用 CapCut、iMovie、DaVinci Resolve 或 KdenLive 之类的应用进行剪辑。不需要做得漂亮！你可以添加很多内容，也可以只添加一点。"}},{"id":"segment-0012","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"When it's done, if you want to share it, platforms like YouTube or social media work. If you want to share it, but not as widely, you can upload to YouTube as an unlisted video and share the link in the <a href=\"https://refold.link/forum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refold community</a>. We would LOVE to see it!","zh":"完成后，如果你想分享，可以使用 YouTube 或社交媒体等平台。如果你想分享但不希望传播得太广，可以将视频作为“不公开”视频上传到 YouTube，然后将链接分享到<a href=\"https://refold.link/forum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refold 社区</a>。我们非常想看到它！"}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"But you don't <em>need</em> to share it. The value is in the creation process itself.","zh":"但你<em>不需要</em>分享。价值就在创作过程本身。"}},{"id":"segment-0014","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Here's Ben's example (with subtitles) that he did in Czech:","zh":"这是 Ben 用捷克语制作的示例（带字幕）："}},{"id":"when-to-start","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Start","zh":"何时开始"}},{"id":"segment-0016","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Video creation is introduced as an optional activity in Phase 6 and becomes more important in Phase 7. It's particularly useful for discovering vocabulary gaps (Phase 6B) — when you try to explain something and can't find the right word, you've found a gap to fill.","zh":"视频创作在第6阶段作为可选活动引入，并在第7阶段变得更加重要。它对于发现词汇缺口尤其有用（第6B阶段）——当你试图解释某件事却找不到合适的词时，你就发现了一个需要填补的缺口。"}}],"cards":[]}}]
